{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 34,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Tribes and Leaders by Armies"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke to Moses and Aaron, saying: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Everyone of the children of Israel shall camp by his own "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "banner"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "standard, beside the emblems of his father’s house; they shall camp some distance from the tabernacle of meeting. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "On the east side, toward the rising of the sun, those of the standard of the forces with Judah shall camp according to their armies; and Nahshon the son of Amminadab "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the leader of the children of Judah.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at seventy-four thousand six hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Those who camp next to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Issachar, and Nethanel the son of Zuar "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the leader of the children of Issachar.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at fifty-four thousand four hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "comes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Zebulun, and Eliab the son of Helon "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the leader of the children of Zebulun.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at fifty-seven thousand four hundred. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“All who were numbered according to their armies of the forces with Judah, one hundred and eighty-six thousand four hundred—these shall "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. set forth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "break camp first."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“On the south side "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the standard of the forces with Reuben according to their armies, and the leader of the children of Reuben "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Elizur the son of Shedeur.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at forty-six thousand five hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Those who camp next to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Simeon, and the leader of the children of Simeon "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Shelumiel the son of Zurishaddai.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at fifty-nine thousand three hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "comes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Gad, and the leader of the children of Gad "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Eliasaph the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Deuel, Num. 1:14; 7:42"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Reuel.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at forty-five thousand six hundred and fifty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“All who were numbered according to their armies of the forces with Reuben, one hundred and fifty-one thousand four hundred and fifty—they shall "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. set forth second"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "be the second to break camp."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And the tabernacle of meeting shall move out with the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "company"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "camp of the Levites in the middle of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "whole company"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "camps; as they camp, so they shall move out, everyone in his place, by their "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "banners"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "standards."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“On the west side "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the standard of the forces with Ephraim according to their armies, and the leader of the children of Ephraim "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Elishama the son of Ammihud.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at forty thousand five hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Next to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "comes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Manasseh, and the leader of the children of Manasseh "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Gamaliel the son of Pedahzur.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at thirty-two thousand two hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "comes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Benjamin, and the leader of the children of Benjamin "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abidan the son of Gideoni.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at thirty-five thousand four hundred. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“All who were numbered according to their armies of the forces with Ephraim, one hundred and eight thousand one hundred—they shall "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. set forth third"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "be the third to break camp."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“The "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "banner"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "standard of the forces with Dan "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the north side according to their armies, and the leader of the children of Dan "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ahiezer the son of Ammishaddai.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at sixty-two thousand seven hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Those who camp next to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Asher, and the leader of the children of Asher "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Pagiel the son of Ocran.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at forty-one thousand five hundred."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "comes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Naphtali, and the leader of the children of Naphtali "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ahira the son of Enan.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his army was numbered at fifty-three thousand four hundred. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“All who were numbered of the forces with Dan, one hundred and fifty-seven thousand six hundred—they shall "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. set forth last"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "break camp last, with their "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "banners"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "standards.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the ones who were numbered of the children of Israel by their fathers’ houses. All who were numbered according to their armies of the forces "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " six hundred and three thousand five hundred and fifty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the Levites were not numbered among the children of Israel, just as the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " commanded Moses."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus the children of Israel did according to all that the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " commanded Moses; so they camped by their "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "banners"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "standards and so they broke camp, each one by his family, according to their fathers’ houses."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}